WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:30.900
George...

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:33.270
What's the big idea asking me
to come here?

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:35.400
I just wanted to see you...

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.110
...once more before
our fight tomorrow.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.410
So, before we deal
with the Devil Gundam...

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.420
...you want a decisive match
against me?

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.580
You still feel that way?

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.080
That's right.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.420
We'll have higher authorities
deal with the Devil Gundam.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:52.040
I'm focusing my attention
solely on defeating you.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.170
To bring honor to my nation.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.590
That is my present duty!

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.810
All for this upcoming battle...

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:08.770
...I devised the Rose Hurricane
technique in the Guyana Highlands.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:10.520
How do you like it?

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.190
What?

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.940
It's the same as your
Rose Bits attack!

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.940
Tell me if you still think so after
you look at your left shoulder!

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:18.820
What?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.320
Wh-when did that get there?

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.080
The Rose Hurricane does not
stop changing its motion.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.540
I could even have directed it
to pierce your neck.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.920
You went out of your way to
show me your new technique?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.720
The Sand Family prides itself
on our insistence to fight fair.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.840
I look forward to our match,
Domon Kasshu.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.590
Wait, George!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.480
Now, everybody.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.610
Domon Kasshu's next
opponent is...

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.570
...as you can see...

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:01.610
...Neo France's Gundam Rose,
piloted by George de Sand.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:02.410
However...

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.990
...to this knight who fights
for his nation's honor...

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:08.830
...an unimaginably cruel fate
is awaiting.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:10.910
And now!

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:15.590
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:21.630
A Knight's Pride!
Gundam Rose Stolen

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:32.140
Oh, George de Sand.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.440
Tea is about to be served.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:34.940
Care to join...?

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:38.860
George?

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.360
Master George!

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.820
Is something the matter,
Raymond?

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.860
You see...

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:46.870
...I just received a message
from the President, and...

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:47.490
Why?!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:50.950
Why must I forfeit my match
against Domon Kasshu?!

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.710
If you battle the God Gundam...

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.290
...regardless of the outcome...

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.770
...Gundam Rose may
incur some sort of damage.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:02.300
Then, it would be more difficult
to win the Final Battle Royale.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:06.590
As a knight, I am obliged not
to show my back to the enemy!

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.140
George.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.170
You know the Gundam Fight
is not a sport.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.390
It's an alternative to war
where the winner secures...

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:16.400
...the right to rule
the solar system.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.650
To be crowned champion,
one must sometimes step back.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:21.690
Fortunately...

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.970
...you have accumulated an
outstanding winning record.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.410
Withdrawing from one match...

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.160
...won't affect your chances to
participate in the Battle Royale.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.700
I don't understand!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.500
What is it to win the Tournament
if this is how it's done?!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.420
I'll say no more.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.670
You may leave.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:37.250
Your Excellency!

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:40.920
George...!

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.970
I take it he wouldn't
reverse his decision.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.430
Master George! Please wait!

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.020
Father!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.460
A Gundam Fighter is a warrior
who fights for his nation.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.150
I must accept my orders.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:03.940
And His Excellency's thinking
is not wrong.

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:06.650
The most important thing
is for us to win.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:09.200
What's one upcoming match, then?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:10.910
Master George...

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.460
Father!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:27.430
Don't you feel anything
seeing George like that?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.220
Even if it's your request...

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.970
...I cannot allow him to fight
against the God Gundam right now.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:37.440
All this time, George has
been fighting for Neo France.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.770
What you are doing is cruel.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.770
My feelings on this won't change,
no matter what you say to me.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:46.740
I never knew you to be
so cold-hearted!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:50.530
George...

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.510
...there's no question
that you are strong.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.790
However, deep within that
incredible strength of yours...

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.000
...I sense a slight weakness.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.210
Here I go! Domon!

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.300
That's it! This is the spin!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:13.010
If only I could defeat
this wild spinning energy!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:19.730
Allenby!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.020
What're you doing?!

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.110
Domon's the one who asked me.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:25.980
Intensive training to
defeat the Rose Hurricane.

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:26.730
Training?

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:30.490
The Bit is a weapon that attacks
from a number of directions.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.740
This is to train the eye for it.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.780
Sure, but at the same time...

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.950
...you're damaging the Gundam
just before the match.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.500
In order to fight the
Devil Gundam...

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.540
...we need to have George
on our team.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.210
And to get George to join us...

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:47.260
...I have to fight him with
all of my might.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.380
Allenby! Do it!

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.510
Okay!

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:03.190
An opponent who he must
fight with all of his might.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.910
<i>Now, everyone!</i>

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.990
<i>Here at Queens Road</i>
<i>East Ring</i>...

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:19.580
...<i>we have an awesome pair to follow</i>
<i>the great Chibodee Crocket bout</i>.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.540
<i>The gong is about to sound</i>...

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.900
...<i>to start this match between</i>
<i>Neo Japan's God Gundam</i>...

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.540
...<i>and Neo France's</i>
<i>Gundam Rose</i>.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:29.710
Matches among the
Shuffle Alliance...

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.760
I'm impressed with your cunning.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:32.550
Yes.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:36.890
I've told Michelo and Chapman
not to meddle with these matches.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.140
I'd hate to spoil such
great battles, after all.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.140
But something's not right.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:45.730
What's keeping the
alI-important Gundam Rose?

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.940
Let me through!

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:52.860
I'm getting on Gundam Rose!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.360
You mustn't!

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.910
Orders from His Excellency!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.030
Let go!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.790
Please, do not get in my way!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.500
I beg you, please let
Master George through.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.250
Please, let him through!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.590
Raymond!

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:08.670
George!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.790
Domon is waiting for me
at the Tournament grounds!

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.380
Please!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.890
Allow me to fight against him!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:16.680
Absolutely not!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.430
George de Sand.

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.640
Are you trying to defy the nation?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:24.810
If you cannot abide by my orders...

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.490
...you'll be dismissed as
our nation's Fighter.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.610
And you will be
charged with treason!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.360
Treason?!

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:37.700
Me? Charged with treason?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.620
Oh, George!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:41.660
B-but...

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.080
...this is so wrong!

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.590
What's the matter, George?

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.590
<i>A bombshell, everyone</i>.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.510
We've just received word
from Neo France.

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.550
They say Gundam Rose is
withdrawing from this match!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.850
Oh, my.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.350
Somebody just decided to
spoil the party.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:02.270
Well...

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:05.760
I think things are starting
to get interesting.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.670
George...

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.690
What the hell happened?

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.760
Watch it, you bastard!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.080
Hey, man.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:40.720
You think you can walk into me
and get away with it?

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.220
I think we'll need a doctor,
so pay up.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:48.600
Wha...? What's with this guy?!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.690
Why, you!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.360
Hey! What do you think
you're doing?!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.320
Sh-shut up!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.370
Talk to him if you've
got a problem.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.590
Tell me, Gundam Rose...

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:16.800
I've never done anything that
would be considered dishonorable.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.000
As a knight, I've been
very proud of that.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:21.590
However...

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.390
...tell me.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.060
What should I do?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:26.730
Gundam Rose...

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.690
Gundam Rose...?

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.190
You too?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.200
What?!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.710
Th-that's Gundam Rose!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:03.140
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.600
Gundam Rose has been stolen?

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.640
And it appears that
the culprit is George.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:11.600
Wow.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.560
He's really done it this time!

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.940
Please.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:18.940
Could we ask you to assist us
in locating Master George?

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.650
I understand.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.240
Let's split up and
check the likely places.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.160
No.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.740
There'll be no need for that.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:26.740
Domon.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.200
What's wrong with us
helping them find George?

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.790
Come on out, George!

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.500
Huh?

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.340
I knew you'd come.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.850
You saw through my plans...

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:46.600
...I see.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.270
Domon Kasshu!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.980
I challenge you
to a decisive match!

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:57.480
Decisive match?

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:58.440
Yes.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.990
Not as a representative of
Neo France...

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.950
...but simply as George de Sand!
It's a personal challenge!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.910
Master George, what are you saying?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.660
It's still not too late.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:11.410
Return the Gundam now and
apologize to my father.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.040
Stay out of this!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.790
You'll be charged with treason.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.750
And the de Sand family
will be dishonored.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.260
Can you live with that, George?!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.380
Yes.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.800
Come to think of it...

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.640
...I've always fought
for the nation...

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.060
...and for the de Sand Family.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:30.430
And also...

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.980
...I have fought for you!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.100
George...

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.190
However, just this one time...

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.110
...I wish to fight for myself!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.290
George...

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.280
Before daybreak...

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.500
...I will await you
in the northern hills.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.750
But...

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:59.210
...you know what'll happen
to you if you fight?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:05.970
I'll await you.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.720
Wait, George!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:11.810
George...

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.100
Why are you doing this?

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.310
What will you do,
Domon Kasshu?

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.860
George de Sand passionately
risks everything he's got.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.110
How will you respond to that...

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.070
...King of Hearts?!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.540
Gundam Rose has been stolen?

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.290
Yes.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.870
The Neo France authorities...

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.000
...are secretly searching for it.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.140
I see.

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:41.040
So that's what's happening.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.460
Notify Master East of this.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:48.010
Tell him things are starting to get
interesting, just as he predicted.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.570
I knew you would come...

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:03.520
...Domon Kasshu.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.240
Yeah.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:10.990
I needed to find out what's
making you take it this far.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:13.950
None of that matters anymore!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.000
Now.
We will start this fight at sunrise.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.290
It's a duel!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:20.790
That's fine!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.370
George...

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.050
Oh, no! They're fighting now.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:06.750
Hurry!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.720
We must stop them at all costs!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.220
The road's blocked
from this point on.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:14.890
What?!

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.930
This matter does not
involve your nation!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.020
They're fighting an
awesome match.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.020
Why not let them finish?

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.280
Hey, hold on!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.070
Stop it!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.740
Stop your fighting!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.410
Father, why are you here?!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.290
I heard that Gundam Rose
was missing...

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.840
...so I had our people
follow the God Gundam.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.710
Stop fighting at once!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.420
I cannot!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:45.630
What?!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:48.420
This fight's only for myself.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.340
I'll fight until the end,
even if I'm punished for it!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.010
Monsieur Domon!

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.720
I'm sure that this match
has no meaning to you!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.060
Please withdraw at once!

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:00.530
I hate to disappoint you...

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:02.770
...but I'm not about to quit either!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:03.850
Domon...

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:06.650
We'll decide if this match
has any meaning.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.190
Stay out of it!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.400
George! You mustn't!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:14.200
Neo France cannot
afford to lose you!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.620
Please, Father.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.740
Please allow George to fight.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.660
You don't mind him
being charged for a crime?

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.830
If this is what he wishes...

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:25.120
...then I shall support him
completely.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.260
George!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:33.630
Domon Kasshu!

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.720
Let's settle this once and for all!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:36.590
Go!

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.810
Rose Hurricane!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.810
This'll finish you!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.660
A-an amazing attack...

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:04.290
Those bit weapons
respond to his mind.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:08.290
That power is coming from the
mind and spirit of George de Sand.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:20.510
You may destroy a few bits
here and there.

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:23.100
But it won't get you
out of that swirl of energy!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.270
No sweat.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.440
That training will come in handy!

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.070
Domon has stopped moving.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.890
Is he finally giving up?

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:35.570
What?!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.450
My turn, George!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.660
My ultimate!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.790
God...

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.500
...Slash...

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.500
...Typhoon!

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.080
God Gundam's rotating?

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.210
No way!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:55.670
Heat End!

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.020
I-incredible!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.270
You did it, Domon!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:15.860
I see.

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:19.280
With the God Slash spinning
along with the bits...

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.410
...the energy forced out
all of my weapons!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.870
Rose Hurricane...

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:24.700
...defeated!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.250
But I will not lose!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.000
Let's go!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.330
Gundam Rose!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:33.630
George!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:34.500
Hold on.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.550
Father...

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.550
He's planning to continue.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.620
Gotcha!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.460
What's the matter?

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.170
The battle isn't over yet!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.590
What energy...

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:20.220
He's not like the George I know.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:27.350
George prides himself in
his graceful fighting style.

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:28.740
But look at him in that state.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.520
Th-this is it!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.690
I wanted to see this energy
from you.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.520
Oh, George...

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.190
Domon Kasshu...

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.360
This will settle it!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:39.530
Very well.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.070
I'll take you on!

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:45.330
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.790
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.670
Erupting...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:00.550
...God Finger!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:05.090
Domon!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.560
George!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.190
George!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:27.200
You're not the King of Hearts
for nothing, Domon Kasshu.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.620
I accept my defeat.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.750
However...

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.000
...it was worth any punishment
that now awaits me.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:34.580
No.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.630
There will be no need for that.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.590
Your Excellency.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:41.170
You have shown me, George...

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:43.680
...your true warrior spirit.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.840
You risked it all...

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:49.740
...to fight and to fulfill your desire
from deep within your heart.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.810
If I'd seen you like this...

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.600
...I never would have forced you
to withdraw from a match.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.310
Th-then...

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:00.150
I will not remove you
from the Gundam.

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.200
Just now...

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:05.110
...you have certainly earned the
right to represent Neo France.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.910
Oh, Father.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:07.700
Thank you.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.120
Domon Kasshu.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.700
It looks like...

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.910
...I'll be able to join you in the
fight against the Devil Gundam.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.210
Yeah.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.420
But the hard part still lies ahead.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:19.750
However...

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:22.420
...once we eliminate the
Devil Gundam...

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:25.400
...I will be sure to defeat you
in the Final Battle Royale.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:26.630
Understand?

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.050
Sure.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:28.850
Fight me at any time.

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:35.440
Martial artists understand
one another...

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.020
...only with their fists.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.020
Undefeated of the East,
Master Asia!

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:42.980
What do you think of this match?!

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:46.200
Well, well, Mr. Wong.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:49.620
These Fights you've arranged
among the Shuffle Alliance...

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.990
...I hope for our sake they don't
come back to haunt us.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:57.250
You're reading too much into this.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.340
Domon's next opponent
is the Ace of Clubs...

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:02.090
...the Dragon Gundam, Sai Saici.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.010
This match should be
even more entertaining.

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:05.800
Well...

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:07.340
This upcoming fight...

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:11.390
...will be the fiercest match
we've seen to date.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:14.890
That's how I see it,
Domon Kasshu.

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:27.860
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:30.370
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:35.660
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:38.210
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:47.010
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:53.970 --> 00:23:01.270
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:05.820
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:09.400
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:16.870
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.710
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:35.350
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:37.810
Sai Saici finds a letter by chance...

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:40.770
...which transforms him into
a steadfast warrior.

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:42.980
Willing to risk his life...

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:45.060
...he challenges Domon
to a final battle...

00:23:45.060 --> 00:23:48.400
...and masters the Shaolin Temple's
most advanced techniques!

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:51.070
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:55.620
Sai Saici's New Attack! Blazing Dragon Gundam.

00:23:53.910 --> 00:24:00.970
Sai Saici's New Attack!
Blazing Dragon Gundam

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.700
Ready! Go!
